{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">佘詩曼向來是知名品牌 Chrome Hearts的忠粉，多年來收藏了不少飾品。日前她有機會與品牌創辦人Richard Stark近距離見面，在社交網晒出多張相片與大家開心share。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"charmaine_sheh_1785936572_3957045153033945468_1819466566.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026htQQUwNZim1785988053.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"charmaine_sheh_1785936572_3957045153033945468_1819466566.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">阿佘見到Richard Stark秒變小粉絲，除了與其拍照留念，更獲他親筆簽名的T恤，難怪阿佘笑不攏嘴，隔着個Mon也見到其喜悅之情。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"w-e-element-73\" style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">一班圈中好友陳山聰、周家蔚和湯盈盈等留言讚好，更表示十分羨慕她，有網民笑言「今次阿佘唔係幫人簽名，自己做粉絲」、「未見過阿佘呢一面」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d4241330-f3dd-4911-a4b6-7e3a1615284e.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026XD8e9aUo8w1785988053.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d4241330-f3dd-4911-a4b6-7e3a1615284e.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"01b33c26-ab52-43dc-a990-394853e32576.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026j0H65sGRVQ1785988054.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"01b33c26-ab52-43dc-a990-394853e32576.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1f846ab9-d11f-4732-af35-9715f2dd3a2f.jpeg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026TqG8qvDdRz1785988054.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1f846ab9-d11f-4732-af35-9715f2dd3a2f.jpeg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T04:59:44.611529+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":227,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}